Within HSUHK, the School of Translation and Foreign Languages (STFL) offers a dynamic portfolio of programmes and is in the process of programme development and renewal. STFL also benefits from an extensive and growing network of partner institutions both in the Chinese Mainland and beyond. In terms of research, School staff achieve excellence in many different areas, while the School is home to two research centres, the GILT Research Centre and the Research Centre for Translation of Buddhist Texts.

