Assist in the coordination of nursing quality assurance programmes, clinical audits, and patient safety initiatives across all clinical units;

Assist in the administrative work related to nursing staff recruitment, onboarding, and performance appraisal processes;

Assist in the planning and execution of nursing training and continuing education programmes;

Assist in manpower planning and management, including monitoring of nursing establishment, staff deployment, rostering, etc.;

Support General Manager (Nursing) in management of financial resources including departmental budget monitoring; and

Perform any other duties as assigned by supervisors.

