This position requires a strong network within the golf industry, commercial acumen, and the ability to integrate golf, lifestyle, travel, and hospitality experiences into a premium membership ecosystem.

Key Responsibilities

• Develop and execute overall golf business strategies, membership growth plans, and revenue objectives;

• Lead and expand GLG’s golf membership platform, partnership ecosystem, and corporate client engagement;

• Build strategic relationships with golf clubs, resorts, tourism boards, luxury brands, airlines, hotels, and event organizers;

• Curate premium golf experiences including tournaments, corporate events, overseas golf tours, and member-exclusive activities;

• Identify and develop regional and international golf tourism opportunities;

• Drive sponsorship acquisition, strategic alliances, and joint venture collaborations;

• Oversee marketing campaigns, membership promotions, exhibitions, and networking events;

• Manage business performance, budgeting, KPI achievement, and profitability targets;

• Lead and mentor internal sales, partnership, and operations teams;

• Represent the company at industry functions, golf events, and business networking occasions.

What We’re Looking For

• Minimum 8–10 years of relevant experience in golf, lifestyle, hospitality, sports marketing, or membership-related industries;

• Strong network within the golf industry in Hong Kong, China, and/or Asia Pacific;

• Proven experience in business development, strategic partnerships, and premium customer engagement;

• Experience organizing golf tournaments, lifestyle events, or sports hospitality programs is highly preferred;

• Strong leadership, communication, and negotiation skills;

• Entrepreneurial mindset with strong commercial awareness;

• Ability to work independently and lead cross-functional collaboration;

• Fluency in English, Cantonese, and Mandarin preferred.

What We Offer

• Competitive remuneration package with attractive performance incentives;

• Regional exposure and leadership opportunities;

• Dynamic and entrepreneurial working environment;

• Opportunities to participate in premium golf, travel, and lifestyle events;

• Career advancement within a rapidly growing lifestyle platform group.

