With a mission to promote and drive digital transformation for education innovation, the Digital Transformation Division (DTD) of the Institute for Higher Education Research and Development (IHERD) seeks individuals with a positive and future-focused mindset who share our vision of digital innovation to join our strong and dynamic team.

Duties

