Bachelor's degree or above with 5+ years in securities, with hands-on experience in HK/US markets and offshore derivatives. Possesses a proven trading system with consistent profitability;

Native Cantonese speaker with on-camera experience. Proficient in various technical indicators and analytical methods. Expertise in specific stock categories or indicators is a plus;

Possesses a distinct investment methodology, excels at identifying trending topics and themes, offers unique insights, and has excellent writing skills;

Able to address client queries professionally and flexibly;

Highly self-motivated, responsible, and resilient under pressure. Passionate about financial markets and driven for excellence.

