The Department of Electrical Engineering (EE) plans to utilise its laboratory areas newly relocated to Tsim Sha Tsui East to establish an innovation hub that integrates research and industry collaboration, anchored by the establishment of 20 Enterprise Labs. The initiative aims to foster dynamic partnerships between academia and industry, strengthening research outcomes, innovation, and technology transfer to the commercial sector.

