About us

D & G Development Limited is a dynamic and forward-thinking organization committed to delivering innovative solutions and exceptional experiences. We pride ourselves on our collaborative culture, creative approach and commitment to excellence across all our operations. Our team is dedicated to building meaningful connections with our audience through strategic marketing and engaging events and promotional campaigns.

About the role

We are seeking a talented Senior Marketing Executive or Marketing Executive (Event & Promotion) to join our retail marketing team on a full-time basis at our office. In this pivotal role, you will assist in planning, executing and promoting a diverse portfolio of events, promotional campaigns and in-store activities that enhance our brand visibility and drive engagement with our target audiences. This position offers an excellent opportunity to showcase your creativity and generate insights whilst contributing directly to the success of our marketing initiatives.

Key Responsibilities :

• Assist in developing marketing strategies and creative campaign planning to achieve business goals;

• Implement marketing campaigns across various channels for brand consistency and maximum reach;

• Participate in handling event budgets, timelines and resources to ensure successful delivery;

• Liaise with external vendors, venues, suppliers and partners to secure services and negotiate terms;

• Create engaging marketing collateral and promotional materials for events and campaigns;

• Coordinate logistics, including venue setup, equipment, staffing and on-site management;

• Collaborate with external agencies and partners for successful marketing project execution;

• Conduct market research, customer surveys, and business analysis to support marketing strategies;

• Handle ad-hoc projects and assignments as required.

Job Requirements :
• Bachelor's degree in Marketing, Communications, Advertising, or related disciplines;

• Minimum 3 years' solid experience in retail marketing, promotion, or public relations, preferably in shopping malls or retail sectors;

• Excellent organizational and time management abilities, with keen attention to detail;

• Creative thinking and the ability to develop innovative event concepts and promotional ideas;

• Proficiency in exhibitions and events to promote products and brand;

• Self-motivated and adaptable with the ability to work independently;

• Highly sensitive to retail trends and customer behavior;

• Proven track record of delivering successful events that achieved measurable outcomes;

• Good commands in both written and spoken English and Chinese;

• Candidate with more experience may be considered as Senior Marketing Executive position.

What we offer

At D & G Development Limited, we are committed to creating a supportive and rewarding workplace where our employees can thrive. We offer competitive remuneration commensurate with experience and qualifications. Our comprehensive benefits package includes health insurance coverage, professional development opportunities and career progression pathways. We foster a collaborative work environment that values innovation, creativity and teamwork. We also offer flexible working arrangements where appropriate, recognizing the importance of work-life balance. Our team members benefit from exposure to diverse projects and the opportunity to develop expertise in various aspects of event management and marketing. We encourage continuous learning and provide opportunities for staff training and skill development to support your career growth within the organisation.
Apply now

If you are a motivated and creative marketing professional with a passion for event management and promotional excellence, we would love to hear from you. Please submit your CV, a cover letter outlining your relevant experience and a portfolio of previous event campaigns to our Human Resources team. Join D & G Development Limited and make a meaningful impact through innovative marketing and memorable events.

