• Building and managing influencer/KOL partnership strategies to extend reach and drive engagement within regional and global performing arts communities;

• Monitoring social media trends, algorithm updates, and audience behaviours to continuously innovate content strategies;

• Analysing channel metrics and campaign performance, translating social media insights into actionable strategies to improve audience conversion, engagement, and brand perception;

• Collaborating with internal teams or external agency partners to align organic social efforts with performance marketing goals.

4. Marketing and Branding:
• Support the implementation and execution of WestK Performing Arts’ branding, communications and marketing strategies that align with its ongoing development of the brand and business objectives.

• Plan and execute branding, marketing, communication, promotional campaigns involving WestK Performing Arts programmes, membership, venues and collaborations.

Performing any other duties from time to time as reasonably assigned by the Authority.

